## Raw and derived participant data stay out of version control.
##
## The Expiwell exports carry `ip address`, `Location - Lat` and
## `Location - Long` alongside the responses. 03_clean.R keeps an explicit
## whitelist of metadata columns and drops all three, but the RAW files still
## contain them -- do not commit them, and do not attach them to the OSF
## component without stripping those columns first.
data/raw/
data/derived/

## The original Expiwell download: the same two exports, same personal data.
Pesquisa_sobre_o_dia_a_dia-*.zip

## Regenerated by R/run_all.R on every run.
output/

.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user
